{"bookId": "3300030519", "title": "当我们不再理解世界（短经典精选）", "bookmarks": {"synckey": 1679591188, "updated": [{"bookId": "3300030519", "bookmarkId": "3300030519_3_12038-12092", "createTime": 1679153910, "range": "12015-12069", "markText": "如今，我们体内将近百分之五十的氮原子都是人工制造出来的，而世界人口的一半多都仰赖于用哈伯的发明施过肥的食料。", "colorStyle": 0, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 4}, {"bookId": "3300030519", "bookmarkId": "3300030519_3_11262-11383", "createTime": 1679153804, "range": "11239-11360", "markText": "一九一八年停战后，弗里茨·哈伯被列为战犯，尽管盟军自己对毒气的热衷丝毫不亚于轴心国。为此，他不得不逃出德国，在瑞士避难，并在那里收到了荣获诺贝尔化学奖的消息：他在战前不久的一项发现不仅为他赢得了这个荣誉，也将在未来几十年内改变整个人类的命运。", "colorStyle": 0, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 4}], "removed": [], "chapters": [{"title": "普鲁士蓝", "chapterUid": 4, "chapterIdx": 4}], "book": {"bookId": "3300030519", "version": 1464372137, "format": "epub", "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/45/cpPlatform_dZetNqgJKGURfWSfLh7jwv/s_cpPlatform_dZetNqgJKGURfWSfLh7jwv.jpg", "title": "当我们不再理解世界（短经典精选）", "author": "本哈明·拉巴图特", "coverBoxInfo": {"blurhash": "KcNKI-Rj009Fj[%MM{fQof", "colors": [{"key": "1/4", "hex": "#1a1d1d"}, {"key": "1/6", "hex": "#1a1d1d"}, {"key": "1/8", "hex": "#1a1d1d"}, {"key": "2/4", "hex": "#2e3132"}, {"key": "2/6", "hex": "#2e3132"}, {"key": "2/8", "hex": "#2e3132"}, {"key": "3/4", "hex": "#444849"}, {"key": "3/6", "hex": "#444849"}, {"key": "3/8", "hex": "#444849"}, {"key": "3/12", "hex": "#444849"}, {"key": "4/6", "hex": "#5c6161"}, {"key": "4/10", "hex": "#5c6161"}, {"key": "4/4", "hex": "#5c6161"}, {"key": "5/10", "hex": "#767a7b"}, {"key": "5/4", "hex": "#767a7b"}, {"key": "5/8", "hex": "#767a7b"}, {"key": "6/4", "hex": "#8f9494"}, {"key": "6/6", "hex": "#8f9494"}, {"key": "6/8", "hex": "#8f9494"}, {"key": "6/12", "hex": "#8f9494"}, {"key": "7/8", "hex": "#a9aeae"}, {"key": "7/10", "hex": "#a9aeae"}, {"key": "7/12", "hex": "#a9aeae"}, {"key": "8/4", "hex": "#c4c9c9"}, {"key": "8/6", "hex": "#c4c9c9"}, {"key": "8/12", "hex": "#c4c9c9"}, {"key": "9/2", "hex": "#dee4e4"}, {"key"